    "ja": "フロウ・ブルーで待ってる"
   },
   {
    "en": "Waiting for You Under the Flow Blue"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The only worry for Ikuma Nagori, an elementary school student who's about perfect at everything he does, is that he has no rivals to compete with. What changed this was his encounter with baseball and Yurimoto Genji, a transfer student from Ehime. In order to \"meet at the Koshien finals in eight years\", the two genius boys put everything they have onto the field.",
   "ja": "小学4年生の幾間余波は、「ライバル」のいない日々に辟易していた。そんな張り合いのない日々を過ごす中で出会ったのは、転校生の百合元ゲンジ。そして、「球を投げて打つだけ」のスポーツだった──。"
  },
